t the constant term, then divide by the signed coefficient of $x$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4x&=\\frac{1}{3}\\ln\\left(5\\right)+1 \\\\ x&=\\frac{1}{4}+\\frac{1}{12}\\ln\\left(5\\right)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $x=\\frac{1}{4}+\\frac{1}{12}\\ln\\left(5\\right)$." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["field-1a88b2b9-e069-5ade-bf41-922384106cbc"] :db/ensure :question/validate} [:db/add 17592186087689 :knowledge-point/questions "question-d7caa798-65a6-5a18-9e68-32237b48aa81"] {:db/id "answer-80b5d948-36db-5aee-b4a2-e00fd020e74f" :answer/id #uuid "80b5d948-36db-5aee-b4a2-e00fd020e74f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=3+\\frac{1}{12}\\ln\\left(7\\right)" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "answer-2fd6b714-2687-5b15-9f1c-b234686350b3" :answer/id #uuid "2fd6b714-2687-5b15-9f1c-b234686350b3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=\\frac{1}{3}-\\frac{1}{18}\\ln\\left(7\\right)" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "answer-6cc6e894-c7c2-5da7-a037-e6d2793b258e" :answer/id #uuid "6cc6e894-c7c2-5da7-a037-e6d2793b258e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=-1+\\frac{1}{18}\\ln\\left(7\\right)" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "answer-a50fbc32-cb5c-5916-8b9c-0128789e07d6" :answer/id #uuid "a50fbc32-cb5c-5916-8b9c-0128789e07d6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=4+\\frac{1}{6}\\ln\\left(7\\right)" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "answer-4528e42b-4cb3-5656-a6ed-76bd6c36b967" :answer/id #uuid "4528e42b-4cb3-5656-a6ed-76bd6c36b967" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=\\frac{8}{5}+\\frac{1}{30}\\ln\\left(7\\right)" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "field-2e54e012-07e8-5186-a265-e29dbd5013b3" :answer-field/id #uuid "2e54e012-07e8-5186-a265-e29dbd5013b3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["answer-80b5d948-36db-5aee-b4a2-e00fd020e74f" "answer-2fd6b714-2687-5b15-9f1c-b234686350b3" "answer-6cc6e894-c7c2-5da7-a037-e6d2